[00:00.76]1. Today, Jehovah God,
[00:05.26]we stand before your throne,
[00:10.56]For you showed the greatest love
[00:15.06]that could ever be shown.
[00:21.31]You gave the gift of your dear Son,
[00:30.31]that we might live.
[00:32.56]No greater sacrifice than this
[00:34.81]could you ever give.
[00:37.06](Chorus)
[00:40.75]He gave his life to set us free.
[00:45.39]His precious blood provides the key.
[00:51.23]With all our hearts,
[00:55.67]we’ll go on thanking you eternally.
[01:02.20]2. It was a willing sacrifice
[01:11.20]that Jesus made.
[01:14.54]Out of love, his perfect life
[01:17.87]was the price that he paid.
[01:22.75]We had no hope until he came
[01:27.25]to save mankind.
[01:31.75]But now our hope is finding life,
[01:34.83]leaving death behind.
[01:37.91](Chorus)
[01:40.99]He gave his life to set us free.
[01:46.83]His precious blood provides the key.
[01:52.67]With all our hearts,
[02:04.32]we’ll go on thanking you eternally.